  ],
  "slug": "one-of-my-days",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1149_one-of-my-days.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I got up at seven today and had something to eat. At nine, I went to school for class. My Chinese isn’t very good, so in the afternoon, my Chinese teacher helped me study. We drank coffee and studied Chinese together. I’m very grateful to my teacher—now I understand it all. At six in the evening, I went home and had dinner with my parents. I don’t feel like reading tonight. Time for bed!"
  ],
  "english_full": "I got up at seven today and had something to eat. At nine, I went to school for class. My Chinese isn’t very good, so in the afternoon, my Chinese teacher helped me study. We drank coffee and studied Chinese together. I’m very grateful to my teacher—now I understand it all. At six in the evening, I went home and had dinner with my parents. I don’t feel like reading tonight. Time for bed!",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Се́годня я встал в се́мь часо́в и по́ел кое-что́. В девя́ть я пошёл в шко́лу на кла́сс. Мой кита́йский я́зык не́т о́чень хоро́ший, поэ́тому в пополу́дни мой кита́йский наста́вник помо́г мне учи́ться. Мы пили ко́фе и учи́ли кита́йский вме́сте. Я о́чень благода́рен сво́ему наста́внику — тепе́рь я всё понима́ю. В шесть часо́в ве́ером я пришёл домо́й и по́ел у́жин с моими роди́телями. Я не́т хо́чу чита́ть се́годня ве́чером. Вре́мя спа́ть!"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Ségodnya ya vstal v sém' chasov i póyel kóe-chto. V devyát' ya poshyól v shkólu na klas. Moy kitáyskiy yázyk nét óchen' khóroshiy, póetomu v popolúdni moy kitáyskiy nastávnik pomóg mne uchítsya. My pili kófe i uchíli kitáyskiy vméste. Ya óchen' blagodáren svóemu nastávniku — tepér' ya vsyo ponimáyu. V shest' chasov véerom ya prishyól domóy i póyel úzhin s moimi rodítelyami. Ya nét khóchu chitát' ségodnya vécherom. Vrémya spat'!"
  ],
